# CODEOWNERS for the ACI Skydiving Framework
#
# Every pull request that touches the files listed below will automatically
# request review from the listed owner(s). Combined with branch protection
# (require review from CODEOWNERS), this enforces that no change reaches
# `main` without the WG Chair's approval.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Owners are GitHub usernames prefixed with @.

# Default catch-all: everything requires the Chair
*                                @abhishekrawat

# Framework canonical document — Chair only
/framework/                      @abhishekrawat

# Annexes (forms, scorecards, templates) — Chair only
/annexes/                        @abhishekrawat

# Decision Records — Chair only (ADRs are append-only and approval-critical)
/decisions/                      @abhishekrawat

# GitHub config and automation — Chair only
/.github/                        @abhishekrawat
/CODEOWNERS                      @abhishekrawat
/CONTRIBUTING.md                 @abhishekrawat
/SCRIBE_PROCESS.md               @abhishekrawat
/README.md                       @abhishekrawat

# Meeting notes — append-only, lighter governance acceptable
# (Still requires Chair, but added here for clarity if delegated later)
